                        "username": "amithash"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you explain include this here instead of somewhere like here: https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/master/meta-facebook/recipes-extended/rsyslog/rsyslog/rsyslog.conf#L12\n\nAlso why not /var/spool/rsyslog? That seems the default."
